WEBVTT

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:13.470
It's pretty quiet around here, isn't it?

00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:18.810
I thought Shinjuku would be lively,
wherever you went.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:21.880
It's because we're on Giou Clan property.

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:24.720
There's a barrier up, too.

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:27.990
A barrier? You mean that thing?

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:34.360
Ordinary humans cannot enter here.
It isn't even marked on maps.

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:38.550
So this place doesn't officially exist?

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:43.740
The Twilight Mansion is at
the end of this tunnel.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:03.870
Only I know your pain...

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:05.970
Your uncertainty...

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:09.710
Your loneliness...

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:14.350
If only we could be together forever.

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:20.850
I'll say it as many times as you wish.

00:01:28.870 --> 00:01:31.070
I will not betray you!

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:16.030
The Twilight Mansion

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:31.480
Excuse me.

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:41.140
I've been awaiting your arrival.

00:03:43.940 --> 00:03:45.410
Nice to meet you.

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:51.440
I look after everyone in this mansion.
I am Kureha Aya.

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:54.060
Please call me Aya, Yuki-sama.

00:03:55.190 --> 00:03:58.220
Huh? Y-You don't have
to call me Yuki-sama.

00:03:58.220 --> 00:03:59.940
There's no need for formality.

00:03:59.940 --> 00:04:01.200
But...

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:03.830
Didn't you hear him?

00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:05.370
There's no need for formality.

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:06.870
Yes...

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:09.120
Very well...

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:10.660
Yuki-san.

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:13.420
Perfect.

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:14.590
Yuki-chan!

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:15.970
Toko-chan.

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:20.380
I was waiting for you!

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:24.140
What's wrong?

00:04:24.140 --> 00:04:28.970
I still don't know how to use
my powers properly.

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:30.350
You shouldn't touch me.

00:04:30.350 --> 00:04:33.060
It's not your fault, Yuki-chan.

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:35.930
People's emotions simply flow into you.

00:04:35.930 --> 00:04:40.820
It's probably more accurate to say that
you're the one who's exposed.

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:43.860
Now, let's try that again!

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:49.080
Everything will be all right...

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:51.370
Toko-chan...

00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:54.790
Welcome back, Yuki-chan.

00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:56.860
I'm home.

00:05:01.430 --> 00:05:03.740
Got a problem with this?

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:06.890
We're relatives. Right, Yuki-chan?

00:05:06.890 --> 00:05:08.580
Y-Yeah.

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:09.890
Yuki.

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:13.380
Welcome back.

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:15.650
I-I'm home.

00:05:16.630 --> 00:05:18.690
Milady!

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:21.860
Huh?

00:05:23.110 --> 00:05:26.820
Zess-kun... I mean, Luka-kun!

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:33.930
Do you intend to keep her to yourself?

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:38.750
It's nice to meet you, milady.
I mean, Yuki-kun.

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:41.260
Welcome to the Twilight Mansion.

00:05:41.260 --> 00:05:45.840
I am Giou Tachibana, the manager.

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:48.800
Just think of me as your resident advisor.

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:50.580
You can talk to me about anything.

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:53.900
Sure. Nice to meet you.

00:05:56.330 --> 00:06:01.480
By the way, those troubles specific
to young men are also welcomeâ

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:06.250
Let's show you around, Yuki-chan.

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:07.530
Sure.

00:06:08.190 --> 00:06:13.430
Luka-kun, why not have a doctor
look at that wound?

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:16.560
That won't be necessary. It's nothing.

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:19.330
Will you let Yuki-kun heal it?

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:22.250
If you don't mind.

00:06:23.930 --> 00:06:24.630
Let's go.

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:27.640
Doctor!

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:29.310
Medical Office

00:06:29.310 --> 00:06:30.350
Doctor!

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:30.950
Danger

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:31.860
Medical Office

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:34.060
Doctor, we're coming in!

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:36.020
Doctor!

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:37.910
Huh?

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:41.720
Hey! Doctor!

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:45.110
Are you here?

00:06:45.470 --> 00:06:46.860
Doctor?

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:48.910
Dr. Isuzu!

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:50.630
Where did he go?

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:52.400
Doctor?

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:53.530
Doctor!

00:06:56.710 --> 00:06:57.710
Yuki!

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:05.300
N-Nice to meet you.

00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:07.230
Who are you?

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:09.850
It's Yuki-kun, doctor.

00:07:09.850 --> 00:07:11.220
Yuki?

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:15.260
Yuki-kun! You know, the one
I told you about, the other day.

00:07:15.260 --> 00:07:21.980
As the Giou Clan's private physician,
he researches Duras.

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:23.730
Duras.

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:27.270
Immersed in my research,
I seem to have forgotten.

00:07:27.270 --> 00:07:31.070
That's charming, but one day,
it'll kill you...

00:07:31.070 --> 00:07:33.320
Well, what do you want?

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:36.470
I was hoping you'd take a
look at Luka-kun's injury.

00:07:37.170 --> 00:07:38.580
Luka?

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:40.700
You know, Zess-kun.

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:43.220
Zess?

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:46.010
Zess...

00:07:48.430 --> 00:07:50.840
Finally changed your mind, have you?

00:07:51.840 --> 00:07:56.350
Zess or Luka, whatever your name is...
Take off your clothes! Show me everything!

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:59.100
Let me examine every inch of your body!

00:07:59.100 --> 00:07:59.750
I'm leaving!

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:00.850
You can't!

00:08:00.850 --> 00:08:03.110
Then I guess we'll have to
ask Yuki-kun to do it.

00:08:08.160 --> 00:08:11.610
If you don't mind.

00:08:12.870 --> 00:08:15.580
If you do anything weird, I'll kill you.

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:18.080
I couldn't ask for more.

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:19.250
Medical Office
Danger

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:19.540
Medical Office

00:08:19.910 --> 00:08:21.330
Danger

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:22.290
Did he shock you?
Danger

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:24.800
A little.

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:28.520
I'm surprised Luka-kun agreed
to the examination.

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:31.840
He must really not want
you healing him, Yuki-kun.

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:35.410
Isn't that why I'm here?

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:38.170
His injuries wouldn't be the
only source of pain.

00:08:38.820 --> 00:08:44.230
He doesn't want to see you suffer
while healing his wounds.

00:08:44.810 --> 00:08:48.230
His heart would ache, I'm sure.

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:52.490
I'll show you to your room.

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:11.570
Yuki-chan...

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:37.010
That's your room, Yuki-kun.

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:44.870
Will he remember everything eventually?

00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:47.500
It's possible.

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:51.460
Will he remember what happened
in the last battle?

00:09:51.810 --> 00:09:53.510
Probably.

00:09:53.510 --> 00:09:59.760
It's awful. We brought him here
without telling him the truth.

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:06.610
We know it will hurt him.

00:10:06.610 --> 00:10:10.360
We know it will only cause him
to suffer more and more.

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:16.140
But you have to keep fighting.

00:10:20.060 --> 00:10:23.080
We all experience pain.

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:24.280
I know.

00:10:41.350 --> 00:10:45.360
The wind is blowing, just
like when I met Luka.

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:55.100
That's Sodom.

00:11:18.540 --> 00:11:19.870
Do you like him?

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:22.230
Yes.

00:11:22.230 --> 00:11:24.350
He's my familiar.

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:25.620
I see.

00:11:26.590 --> 00:11:29.660
How is your wound?

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:33.560
It's fine. Don't worry about it.

00:11:36.760 --> 00:11:39.820
This place is like a whole other world.

00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:45.160
The building is practically a castle.
And for Tokyo, it's unbelievably quiet.

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:48.810
I can't even hear the children's voices.

00:11:49.510 --> 00:11:51.090
Do you worry about them?

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:54.300
The children?

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:56.630
No.

00:11:58.300 --> 00:12:01.410
They're all strong kids.

00:12:02.630 --> 00:12:06.900
I do worry about Kanata-san, though.

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:09.710
Kanata?

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:12.940
At the Asahi Orphanage,
we were inseparable.

00:12:12.940 --> 00:12:15.480
He was like my brother.

00:12:18.240 --> 00:12:24.780
<i>Pain, pain, go away.</i>

00:12:25.170 --> 00:12:26.810
<i>Don't you remember?</i>

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:32.650
<i>When you were little, you'd always
say that to anyone who was crying.</i>

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:35.210
<i>Really?</i>

00:12:35.210 --> 00:12:37.450
<i>I don't remember.</i>

00:12:39.210 --> 00:12:41.430
<i>Honestly, it was curious.</i>

00:12:41.670 --> 00:12:47.580
<i>I wondered, how can child try
so hard to help others?</i>

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:53.230
<i>How can he, when he's
experienced far worse?</i>

00:12:54.390 --> 00:12:55.690
<i>But somehow,</i>

00:12:56.480 --> 00:13:01.450
<i>it must simply be natural
for you to do that.</i>

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.940
<i>It's just how you are.</i>

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:14.490
Kanata-san said he used to think of
humans as trifling creatures.

00:13:14.490 --> 00:13:20.700
But that, after meeting me, he gained
hope for humanity and the future.

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:27.260
He said we were different.
That I'd never be alone...

00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:33.510
Now that I think about it,
those must have been his parting words.

00:13:33.510 --> 00:13:36.730
But at the time, I didn't realize it.

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:42.900
I wish I could have told him
I was going to Tokyo...

00:13:46.310 --> 00:13:47.570
I...

00:14:00.260 --> 00:14:01.430
Come in.

00:14:02.430 --> 00:14:03.940
Excuse me.

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:11.100
Are you going to stay up?

00:14:11.300 --> 00:14:15.680
Yes. The situation is changing
by the second.

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:17.720
I can't possibly rest yet.

00:14:20.320 --> 00:14:22.690
Regardless, you must take a break.

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:32.120
Rosemary... What a pleasant smell.

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:34.870
Well, please excuse me.

00:14:36.410 --> 00:14:37.500
Ibuki.

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:38.860
Yes?

00:14:40.170 --> 00:14:42.710
Have you ever lied?

00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:48.690
Yes. I've lied numerous times,
to those other than you, Takashiro-sama.

00:14:49.300 --> 00:14:51.310
You truly are amazing.

00:14:51.310 --> 00:14:53.270
Your answer was perfect.

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:06.610
I do nothing but deceive...

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:14.250
Luka.

00:15:16.980 --> 00:15:20.210
Aren't you tired, Luka?

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:24.550
You fought for me multiple times.

00:15:24.550 --> 00:15:27.520
You must be even more tired than I am.

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:30.470
Sleep.

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:32.950
Don't worry about anything.

00:15:33.630 --> 00:15:35.290
Thank you.

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:41.460
Yuki. Yuki.

00:15:43.980 --> 00:15:45.440
Kanata-san.

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:47.470
I'm sorry, Yuki.

00:15:48.570 --> 00:15:50.610
I have to go.

00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:54.790
You lied to me.

00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:58.080
We can't be together anymore.

00:15:58.370 --> 00:16:02.170
Wait! What are you saying?

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:04.880
I love you, Kanata-san.

00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:07.610
I want to be with you forever!

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:10.550
I want to walk beside you forever!

00:16:10.550 --> 00:16:12.180
Kanata-san!

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:22.770
Goodbye, Yuki.

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:26.150
Why?

00:16:46.470 --> 00:16:49.950
I'm sorry, Kanata-san...

00:16:52.810 --> 00:16:54.430
I'm sorry...

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:58.430
Hey, Reiga-sama.

00:16:58.720 --> 00:17:01.460
Can we go outside yet?

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:03.670
We're bored.

00:17:03.670 --> 00:17:08.020
I want to play outside, too...

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:09.650
Not yet.

00:17:10.100 --> 00:17:12.280
The curtain will rise soon.

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:14.620
Whether they're ready or not.

00:17:21.210 --> 00:17:25.480
Stay here until I give you your orders.

00:17:25.860 --> 00:17:28.090
Where are you going, Reiga-sama?

00:17:28.490 --> 00:17:30.550
None of your business.

00:17:30.550 --> 00:17:34.340
No fair! You're going outside alone...

00:17:42.070 --> 00:17:43.140
Morning!

00:17:43.480 --> 00:17:44.530
Morning.

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:46.240
Good morning.

00:17:46.240 --> 00:17:47.230
Morning.

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:50.400
Good morning.

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:01.660
Did you sleep well last night?

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:04.150
Yes, thanks to you.

00:18:04.150 --> 00:18:07.050
Then you like it here?

00:18:07.990 --> 00:18:09.000
Yes.

00:18:12.470 --> 00:18:16.130
There are things about this place
that feel very familiar,

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:22.710
as though I once lived here, long ago.

00:18:26.230 --> 00:18:30.030
I've gained something extremely valuable.

00:18:30.680 --> 00:18:33.620
I can regain what I've lost.

00:18:33.620 --> 00:18:37.360
I'm happy I feel this way.

00:18:42.840 --> 00:18:44.200
Yuki-chan.

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:45.420
Yes?

00:18:45.920 --> 00:18:47.080
Yuki-chan...

00:18:49.360 --> 00:18:52.150
What's important to you?

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:56.220
That's...

00:18:59.090 --> 00:19:00.600
Don't worry.

00:19:02.630 --> 00:19:06.740
We just want to hear how you really feel.

00:19:11.910 --> 00:19:13.480
My relationships, I guess.

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:16.670
I'm sorry.

00:19:17.490 --> 00:19:19.410
I'm sorry, Yuki-chan...

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:24.910
But we've been waiting such a
long time for you, Yuki-chan.

00:19:27.190 --> 00:19:29.960
We really wanted to see you.

00:19:30.360 --> 00:19:31.470
Really...

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:34.510
Thank you.

00:19:34.710 --> 00:19:38.840
I'm glad I met all of you, too.

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:45.680
Splendid... Youthful,
even this early in the morning.

00:19:45.680 --> 00:19:47.020
Truly splendid.

00:19:47.020 --> 00:19:50.230
I hope, eventually,
I can be a part of that.

00:19:50.830 --> 00:19:52.040
Um...

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:54.120
Doctor, did you shave?

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:55.220
Huh?

00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:57.320
Doctor?

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:05.080
What?

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:08.870
Dr. Isuzu...

00:20:08.870 --> 00:20:11.460
My name is Fujiwara Isuzu.

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:14.580
In order to keep you from using
your powers, as much as possible,

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:18.840
I've even forgone shaving,
in favor of Duras research.

00:20:18.840 --> 00:20:20.570
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:23.770
The pleasure's all mine.

00:20:24.150 --> 00:20:25.320
By the way...

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:26.060
Huh?

00:20:28.270 --> 00:20:33.800
It'd be great if you'd tell that idiot to
let me examine him once in a while.

00:20:33.800 --> 00:20:34.650
Sodom!

00:20:40.110 --> 00:20:42.830
The legendary dragon, Sodom!

00:20:42.830 --> 00:20:48.810
Give yourself to my great research!

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:55.130
What was that?

00:20:56.110 --> 00:20:58.010
Let go! Let go of me!

00:20:58.010 --> 00:20:59.150
Ka-chan.

00:20:59.630 --> 00:21:03.080
This is Yuki-kun, our newest resident.

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:08.440
This is Toma Kasumi-kun.
He's the Twilight Mansion's cook.

00:21:09.350 --> 00:21:10.980
Nice to meet you.

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:12.240
Oh, no...

00:21:13.240 --> 00:21:16.230
Nice to meet you.

00:21:16.230 --> 00:21:18.770
Toma-san, I'm famished.

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:20.530
Just a minute!

00:21:23.450 --> 00:21:25.850
Behave yourself, Sodom.

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:27.970
Come.

00:21:30.660 --> 00:21:31.930
Good boy.

00:21:35.380 --> 00:21:38.680
Toko-chan, where are Hotsuma-kun
and Shusei-kun?

00:21:38.680 --> 00:21:40.880
Huh? Oh, right...

00:21:41.130 --> 00:21:42.380
Shusei!

00:21:45.810 --> 00:21:47.550
Why'd you leave me behind?

00:21:47.550 --> 00:21:49.380
Once in a while, it won't hurt you.

00:21:49.380 --> 00:21:51.120
What are you saying?

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:01.270
Yuki...

00:23:36.030 --> 00:23:40.340
Hey, Shusei, why do we have
to attend high school?

00:23:40.340 --> 00:23:43.130
As Zweilt Guardians, we've
got other stuff to doâ

00:23:43.130 --> 00:23:46.090
You didn't do your homework again, right?

00:23:46.090 --> 00:23:46.150
How did you know?

00:23:46.150 --> 00:23:47.720
Brand Zess

00:23:47.720 --> 00:23:49.440
You never do it.

00:23:49.440 --> 00:23:49.960
Brand Zess
